  "has_quantitative_results": true,
  "summary": "The paper presents a digitized-counterdiabatic quantum optimization (DCQO) method for 20-asset portfolio optimization on IonQ's 20-qubit trapped-ion Aria device. It reports that pure DCQO achieves approximation ratio 0.54 in simulation (and 0.50 with debiasing on hardware) versus 0.53 for finite-time digitized-adiabatic evolution, while h-DCQO reaches 0.72 in simulation and 0.58 on hardware, with a reported 2.5x circuit-depth reduction versus QAOA and 5x fewer parameters.",
